<li></li>
</ol>
<p><img height="766" src="https://d2b8wt72ktn9a2.cloudfront.net/mediocre/image/upload/v1780588017/v7iaxykwyc59u3qgvkk3.png" width="572" /></p>
<p>So, this is a pretty great product photo. The potential for scares really comes down to the viewer’s fear of the unknown. Maybe you see the absolute darkness beyond the light as teeming with monsters. Or maybe you see it as the perfect visual representation of emptiness. Due to this variance, our rating can’t be <em>too</em> high.</p>
<p><strong>Creepiness rating</strong>: 5/10</p>
